Local method extraction and numerical compatibility

GSAS-II source copyright2010 UChicago Argonne LLC, operator of Argonne
National Laboratory. Complete custom open-source license is preserved in
LICENSE. Mathematical extraction by benchmark maintainers2026: explicit
indexed geometry, P21 orbit bookkeeping, double-threshold sign flips, FFT
updates, source origin heuristic and independent evaluator. No GSAS-II
reconstruction library is imported by the runtime or normal tests.

The original NumPy1.26 method ran unchanged. A separate private NumPy2.4
oracle copy changed only reshape(...,newshape=steps) to the equivalent
positional shape argument in the postprocessing origin routine. No physical
equation or numerical operation changed; this is explicitly qualified.

