Existing real measurements are from the author's licensed tutorial repository.
The supplied FCF has a model-based global intensity scale; benchmark input
uses only measured-RMS-normalized Fo-squared and its uncertainties, removing
that absolute multiplicative calibration. Calculated amplitudes/phases,
F000 and atom coordinates are not released as solver input or used by the
reconstruction. A separate external-data redistribution grant was not
identified; this local research package makes no broader data-license claim.
